@@ -3,6 +3,13 @@
 A Node.js gRPC library that is nice to you. Built on top of
 [`grpc-js`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@grpc/grpc-js).
 
+Local candidate unary patch: for an ordinary grpc-js client call that returns a
+native handle, the unary promise settles after local terminal status and this
+wrapper's synchronous header/trailer observers finish. A synchronous observer
+failure rejects the promise while preserving any distinct call failure. This
+does not establish remote handler completion or cover an inaccessible partial
+call when native construction throws without returning a handle.
+
 - [Features](#features)
 - [Installation](#installation)
 - [Usage](#usage)
